> f(x: u8) = x
> g(x: u8) = x where x < 256
  note: literal 256 does not fit u8; it becomes 0
> domain g
domain of g:
  x: u8, 0..255
  where x < 0
  defined at 0 of 0 points
  empty domain: undefined at every point of the parameter types
  over all 0 points of the domain
> equiv f ~ g
f and g differ at 256 points, e.g. x=0: 0 vs undefined
